---
description: Never attribute commits or PRs to Cursor
alwaysApply: true
---

# Commits y PRs: sin atribución Cursor; PRs en español

- Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor` or `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>` to commit messages.
- Never add `Made with Cursor`, Cursor badges, or similar footers to PR bodies.
- If the environment auto-appends either, rewrite/edit so the final commit message and PR description have no Cursor attribution before finishing.
- Do not attribute work to the agent unless the user explicitly asks.
- Write PR titles and bodies in **Spanish** (Resumen, Plan de prueba, etc.) unless the user asks otherwise.
